     <div style=\"font-weight:900; color:#0f172a; margin:0 0 6px;\">\n        This listing is for a <span style=\"color:#b45309;\">USED - LIKE NEW</span> projector.\n      </div>\n\n      <ul style=\"margin:0; padding-left:18px; line-height:1.45;\">\n        <li>\n          See product listing for complete details on usage. \n        </li>\n        <li>\n          Fully tested by <span style=\"font-weight:900;\">Elite Sim Golf</span>\n        </li>\n        <li>\n          Original box, manual, and accessories <span style=\"font-weight:900;\">included</span>\n        </li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Small reassurance line -->\n    <div style=\"\n      margin-top:8px;\n      font-size:12px;\n      color:#64748b;\n    \">\n      Questions about condition or compatibility? Contact us and we’ll help confirm fit for your simulator setup.\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n{%- endif -%}\n\n{%- comment -%}\nNEW OPEN BOX / OPEN BOX STATUS BOX\nHow to trigger:\n- Add product tag: open-box\n(Optional) You can change the tag name below.\n{%- endcomment -%}\n\n{%- assign show_open_box_box = false -%}\n{%- if product.tags contains 'open-box' -%}\n  {%- assign show_open_box_box = true -%}\n{%- endif -%}\n\n{%- if show_open_box_box -%}\n<div style=\"\n  margin:14px 0 0;\n  padding:14px 16px;\n  border-radius:16px;\n  border:2px solid #f59e0b;\n  background:linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff 0%, #fff7ed 100%);\n  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;\n  color:#0f172a;\n  display:flex;\n  align-items:flex-start;\n  gap:12px;\n  box-shadow:0 10px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\n\">\n  <div style=\"\n    width:34px; height:34px; border-radius:12px;\n    background:#ffedd5;\n    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;\n    font-size:18px; flex:0 0 auto;\n    border:1px solid rgba(245,158,11,.25);\n  \">🟡</div>\n\n  <div style=\"line-height:1.25; flex:1;\">\n    <!-- Header row -->\n    <div style=\"\n      display:flex;\n      align-items:center;\n      justify-content:space-between;\n      gap:10px;\n      margin:0 0 8px;\n    \">\n      <div style=\"font-weight:900; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:.02em;\">\n        Item Condition\n      </div>\n\n      <div style=\"\n        display:inline-flex;\n        align-items:center;\n        gap:8px;\n        padding:6px 10px;\n        border-radius:999px;\n        background:#f59e0b;\n        color:#ffffff;\n        font-weight:900;\n        font-size:12px;\n        letter-spacing:.02em;\n        white-space:nowrap;\n        box-shadow:0 8px 18px rgba(245,158,11,.25);\n      \">\n        ✅ NEW OPEN BOX\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Main notice -->\n    <div style=\"\n      background:#ffffff;\n      border:1px solid rgba(15,23,42,.10);\n      border-radius:12px;\n      padding:10px 12px;\n      font-size:12.5px;\n      color:#334155;\n    \">\n      <div style=\"font-weight:900; color:#0f172a; margin:0 0 6px;\">\n        This listing is for a <span style=\"color:#b45309;\">New Open Box</span> projector.\n      </div>\n\n      <ul style=\"margin:0; padding-left:18px; line-height:1.45;\">\n        <li>\n          Mounted and returned within <span style=\"font-weight:900;\">30 days</span> of delivery\n        </li>\n        <li>\n          Fully tested by <span style=\"font-weight:900;\">Elite Sim Golf</span>\n        </li>\n        <li>\n          Retains the <span style=\"font-weight:900;\">full 3-year BenQ factory warranty</span>\n        </li>\n        <li>\n          <span style=\"font-weight:900;\">2 hours or less</span> bulb time to qualify as New Open Box\n        </li>\n        <li>\n          Original box, manual, and accessories <span style=\"font-weight:900;\">included</span>\n        </li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Small reassurance line -->\n    <div style=\"\n      margin-top:8px;\n      font-size:12px;\n      color:#64748b;\n    \">\n      Questions about condition or compatibility? Contact us and we’ll help confir